# Trivy findings accepted for now. The trivy job still blocks on every High
# and Critical finding not listed here.
# Each entry needs: a CVE id with an exp: date on the same line, and a
# one-line reason and an issue link as comment lines directly above it.
# Trivy stops ignoring an entry after its exp: date, so the job blocks on
# that finding again without anyone having to remember it.
# Example (not active):
#   # Reason: no fixed version exists. Issue: <link>.
#   CVE-0000-00000 exp:2026-12-31
